4","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","number":23,"title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2978,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-05-22T16:25:52Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T16:23:23Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-01-26T18:09:14Z"},"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-11-20T23:58:22Z","updated_at":"2025-11-21T20:52:52Z","closed_at":"2025-11-21T20:52:42Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113000","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113000","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113000.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113000.patch","merged_at":"2025-11-21T20:52:42Z"},"body":"While running my own build of Godot 4.5.1 I was seeing heap corruption in D3D12 code. To investigate I made a dev build and found I was hitting a dev assert in the D3D12 CPU descriptor heap management logic:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1342\" height=\"694\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1c042ba2-15ca-4075-acbe-c967e350e522\" />\r\n\r\nI believe the problem due to the order of deletion and update, specifically:\r\n\r\n```c++\r\nfree_blocks_by_offset.erase(next->value.global_offset);\r\n```\r\n\r\n`next->value.global_offset` always matches the key of the pair in this RBMap, so this is erasing \"next\" itself. So the `next` iterator now points to deleted memory, but then `next` is updated and put back into free_blocks_by_offset. Since `next` points to deleted memory, this is undefined behavior. In my debug builds, you can see in the screenshot that some kind of sentinel values get set to make this \"use-after-free\" issue more obvious.\r\n\r\nTo fix this I create a block separate from the one that `next` points to so I can mutate it before deleting the old block and inserting in the new merged block. I don't know if this fixes the original heap corruption but it does fix the DEV_ASSERT (on line 497 in my screenshot) and corrupted block data.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113000/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113000/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}